        "id": 256304,
        "name": "Lydia (she/her/hers)",
        "username": "Lydia",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lydia/{size}/6181_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-01-09T16:16:46.509Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello Everyone!</p>\n<p>My name is Lydia-Rae Wehmeyer (Lydia), pronouns are she/her/hers and I will be your new Crowdfunding and Customer Service Specialist for GTG!</p>\n<p>I am so happy to be here! A little bit about me:</p>\n<p>I’ve been in the tabletop industry for about 4 years now on the convention side presenting panels and workshops on how to incorporate tabletop gaming and RPGS with education, mental health, accessibility and DE&amp;I. In addition, I am also a DE&amp;I consultant for Stonemaier Games and have worked on many projects with companies such as Lucky Duck and Japanime.</p>\n<p>I’ve always wanted to find a place in the hobby and didn’t get into it until I was 21. My entry way game was Lords of Waterdeep and my love for board games have been strong ever since.</p>\n<p>I look forward to communicating with all of you and have a wonderful day.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-01-09T16:16:46.509Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
